# TCA 组合式架构实战

## 核心概念

The Composable Architecture（TCA）是 Point-Free 团队开源的 SwiftUI 架构框架，截至 2026 年 4 月已迭代至 1.25.x 版本。它借鉴 Elm Architecture 和 Redux 的单向数据流思想，通过五个核心组件——State、Action、Reducer、Store、Effect——将应用逻辑封装为可组合、可测试、可预测的模块。在 Swift 6 严格并发和 `@Observable` 宏的加持下，TCA 已全面拥抱 `@ObservableState` 宏替代旧有的 ViewStore 桥接层。

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    View -->|发送 Action| Store
    Store -->|传递给| Reducer
    Reducer -->|纯函数,修改| State
    Reducer -->|返回| Effect
    Effect -->|异步结果作为新 Action| Store
    State -->|驱动| View
```

| 组件    | 职责                                          | 类型                               |
| ------- | --------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| State   | 功能模块的全量数据快照                        | 值类型 struct + `@ObservableState` |
| Action  | 用户事件或系统回调的枚举                      | enum + `@CasePathable`             |
| Reducer | 接收 Action、修改 State、返回 Effect 的纯函数 | `@Reducer` 宏标注的 struct         |
| Store   | 运行时容器，持有 State 并分发 Action          | `StoreOf<Feature>`                 |
| Effect  | 描述副作用（网络、定时器、系统 API）          | `Effect<Action>`                   |

## Reducer 定义与组合

TCA 1.7+ 引入 `@Reducer` 宏，大幅减少样板代码：

```swift
import ComposableArchitecture

@Reducer
struct CounterFeature {
    @ObservableState
    struct State: Equatable {
        var count = 0
        var numberFact: String?
        var isLoadingFact = false
    }

    enum Action {
        case incrementButtonTapped
        case decrementButtonTapped
        case factButtonTapped
        case factResponse(String)
    }

    var body: some ReducerOf<Self> {
        Reduce { state, action in
            switch action {
            case .incrementButtonTapped:
                state.count += 1
                return .none

            case .decrementButtonTapped:
                state.count -= 1
                return .none

            case .factButtonTapped:
                state.isLoadingFact = true
                return .run { [count = state.count] send in
                    let (data, _) = try await URLSession.shared.data(
                        from: URL(string: "http://numbersapi.com/\(count)")!
                    )
                    let fact = String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)
                    await send(.factResponse(fact))
                }

            case .factResponse(let fact):
                state.isLoadingFact = false
                state.numberFact = fact
                return .none
            }
        }
    }
}
```

## 子模块组合与 Scope

大型应用由多个 Feature 组合而成。TCA 通过 `Scope` 和 `ifLet` / `forEach` 操作符将子 Reducer 嵌入父级：

```swift
@Reducer
struct AppFeature {
    @ObservableState
    struct State {
        var counter = CounterFeature.State()
        var settings = SettingsFeature.State()
        @Presents var detail: DetailFeature.State?
    }

    enum Action {
        case counter(CounterFeature.Action)
        case settings(SettingsFeature.Action)
        case detail(PresentationAction<DetailFeature.Action>)
    }

    var body: some ReducerOf<Self> {
        Scope(state: \.counter, action: \.counter) {
            CounterFeature()
        }
        Scope(state: \.settings, action: \.settings) {
            SettingsFeature()
        }
        Reduce { state, action in
            // 父级逻辑
            .none
        }
        .ifLet(\.$detail, action: \.detail) {
            DetailFeature()
        }
    }
}
```

## 副作用管理：Effect 与依赖注入

Effect 将所有异步/不纯操作封装为声明式描述。TCA 的 `@Dependency` 系统提供编译时安全的依赖查找：

```swift
// 声明依赖接口
struct NumberFactClient {
    var fetch: @Sendable (Int) async throws -> String
}

extension NumberFactClient: DependencyKey {
    static let liveValue = NumberFactClient { number in
        let (data, _) = try await URLSession.shared.data(
            from: URL(string: "http://numbersapi.com/\(number)")!
        )
        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)
    }
}

// 在 Reducer 中使用
@Dependency(\.numberFactClient) var numberFactClient

case .factButtonTapped:
    return .run { [count = state.count] send in
        let fact = try await numberFactClient.fetch(count)
        await send(.factResponse(fact))
    }
```

## TestStore 行为验证

TCA 的杀手特性是 `TestStore`——它验证每一步 Action 引起的 State 变化和 Effect 行为：

```swift
@Test
func testIncrement() async {
    let store = TestStore(initialState: CounterFeature.State()) {
        CounterFeature()
    }

    await store.send(.incrementButtonTapped) {
        $0.count = 1
    }

    await store.send(.decrementButtonTapped) {
        $0.count = 0
    }
}

@Test
func testFact() async {
    let store = TestStore(initialState: CounterFeature.State(count: 42)) {
        CounterFeature()
    } withDependencies: {
        $0.numberFactClient.fetch = { _ in "42 is the answer" }
    }

    await store.send(.factButtonTapped) {
        $0.isLoadingFact = true
    }

    await store.receive(\.factResponse) {
        $0.isLoadingFact = false
        $0.numberFact = "42 is the answer"
    }
}
```

## @Shared 状态与跨 Feature 通信

TCA 1.25+ 的 `@Shared` 属性包装器允许多个 Feature 共享同一份持久化状态：

```swift
@ObservableState
struct AppState {
    @Shared(.appStorage("onboardingComplete")) var onboardingComplete = false
    @Shared(.inMemory("currentUser")) var currentUser: User?
}
```

## 小结

- TCA 用单向数据流 + Reducer 组合实现了可预测、可测试的 SwiftUI 架构
- `@ObservableState` 替代旧版 ViewStore，直接享受属性级精准刷新
- Effect + `@Dependency` 让副作用可控、可 Mock
- TestStore 提供步进式行为验证，覆盖状态变化和异步 Effect
- 适合中大型应用；小型应用可先用 `@Observable` + 轻量 ViewModel 过渡

```mermaid
mindmap
  root((TCA 核心))
    State
      值类型
      @ObservableState
    Action
      枚举
      @CasePathable
    Reducer
      纯函数
      可组合
    Effect
      异步描述
      依赖注入
    Store
      运行时容器
      View 绑定
```

